      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "JOGO CRIADO POR\n\n\nClara Nelson\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\nJoao Vitor
    Lima\nJoao Pedro Santos\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\nVitor Cesar\n\n\nORIENTADOR\nLuis
    Felipe Matsya\n\n\nGERENTE\nJoao Vitor Lima\n\n\nARTE 2D\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nARTE
    3D\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nTEXTURAS\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda
    Cezar\n\n\nANIMACOES\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nPROGRAMACAO\nJoao
    Vitor Lima\nVitor Cesar\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\n\n\nUNITY DEVELOPERS\nJoao
    Vitor Lima\nVItor Cesar\n\n\nUI/UX DESIGN\nIvan Marinho\n\n\nDESIGN INTERFACES\nIvan
    Marinho\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nAUDIO\nDaniel Amaral\n\n\nGAME/LEVEL DESIGN\nClara
    Nelson\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\nJoao Vitor Lima\nJoao Pedro Santos\nMaria
    Eduarda Cezar\nVitor Cesar\n\n\nVISUAL EFFECTS\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nCREDITOS/CONTEUDOS\nBoing-SFX.mp3
    - elfstonepress\n\nGame Jump Sound - Boing  - el_boss\n\nAfternoon Woods in October
    - Midwest US (loop) - NickTayloe\n\n Countryside Ambience Spring - Kinoton\nBird
    Park Ambience - nick121087\n\nambience, city, sokolniki park, late winter, Moscow
    - AlexanderChe\n\nPop in sfx - Sadiquecat\n\n\n\nOBRIGADO POR JOGAR!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2b10c34c19e24c346b65c121f2276d63, type: 2}
